{
  "info": {
    "name": "OneOhm - Users & Employee Onboarding",
    "_postman_id": "oneohm-users-collection",
    "description": "User Management & Employee Onboarding API Collection\n\n## Employee Onboarding Flow\n1. Create User (POST /users)\n2. Create Employee Profile (POST /users/:id/profiles)\n3. Assign Specific Roles (optional)\n\n## Profile Types\n- `customer` - Customer profile\n- `employee` - Employee profile  \n- `reseller` - Reseller profile",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{accessToken}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8085/api/v1",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "accessToken",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "userId",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "organizationId",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "🔐 Auth (Get Token First)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login (Get Access Token)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', jsonData.accessToken);",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', jsonData.refreshToken);",
                  "    console.log('✅ Tokens saved successfully');",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"admin@oneohm.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Admin@123\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "login"]
            },
            "description": "Login to get access token. Tokens are automatically saved to collection variables."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "👤 User Management",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Create User",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "    const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('userId', jsonData.id);",
                  "    console.log('✅ User created. ID saved: ' + jsonData.id);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"firstName\": \"Rahul\",\n  \"lastName\": \"Sharma\",\n  \"email\": \"rahul.sharma@example.com\",\n  \"phone\": \"+919876543210\",\n  \"password\": \"SecurePass123!\",\n  \"status\": \"active\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/users",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["users"]
            },
            "description": "Create a new user (Step 1 of onboarding).\n\n**Required Fields:**\n- `firstName`: User's first name\n- `phone`: Phone number (E.164 format)\n\n**Optional Fields:**\n- `lastName`: User's last name\n- `email`: Email address\n- `password`: Password (required for email login)\n- `status`: active/inactive/suspended\n- `roles`: Array of role codes"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Create User (Minimal - OTP Only)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "    const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('userId', jsonData.id);",
                  "    console.log('✅ User created. ID saved: ' + jsonData.id);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"firstName\": \"Priya\",\n  \"phone\": \"+919876543211\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/users",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["users"]
            },
            "description": "Create a minimal user for OTP-only authentication.\nNo password or email required."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Get All Users",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/users?page=1&limit=20",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["users"],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "page",
                  "value": "1"
                },
                {
                  "key": "limit",
                  "value": "20"
                },
                {
                  "key": "status",
                  "value": "active",
                  "disabled": true
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Get paginated list of all users.\n\n**Query Parameters:**\n- `page`: Page number (default: 1)\n- `limit`: Items per page (default: 20)\n- `status`: Filter by status (active/inactive/suspended)"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Get User by ID",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["users", "{{userId}}"]
            },
            "description": "Get a specific user by their ID."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Update User",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"firstName\": \"Rahul\",\n  \"lastName\": \"Sharma Updated\",\n  \"email\": \"rahul.updated@example.com\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["users", "{{userId}}"]
            },
            "description": "Update user's basic information."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Update User Status",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"status\": \"active\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}/status",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["users", "{{userId}}", "status"]
            },
            "description": "Update user's status.\n\n**Status Options:**\n- `active`\n- `inactive`\n- `suspended`"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Delete User",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["users", "{{userId}}"]
            },
            "description": "Soft delete a user."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "👔 Employee Onboarding",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Step 1: Create User for Employee",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "    const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('userId', jsonData.id);",
                  "    console.log('✅ Step 1 Complete - User created: ' + jsonData.id);",
                  "    console.log('➡️ Now run Step 2: Create Employee Profile');",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"firstName\": \"Amit\",\n  \"lastName\": \"Patel\",\n  \"email\": \"amit.patel@oneohm.com\",\n  \"phone\": \"+919876543212\",\n  \"password\": \"Employee@123\",\n  \"status\": \"active\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/users",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["users"]
            },
            "description": "**Step 1 of Employee Onboarding**\n\nCreate the base user account for the employee.\nThe userId will be saved automatically for Step 2."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Step 2: Create Employee Profile",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "    const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "    console.log('✅ Step 2 Complete - Employee profile created');",
                  "    console.log('✅ Role auto-assigned: employee_basic');",
                  "    console.log('🎉 Employee onboarding complete!');",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"organizationId\": \"{{organizationId}}\",\n  \"profileType\": \"employee\",\n  \"profileData\": {\n    \"employeeId\": \"EMP001\",\n    \"designation\": \"Sales Executive\",\n    \"department\": \"Sales\",\n    \"joiningDate\": \"2024-01-15\",\n    \"email\": \"amit.patel@company.com\",\n    \"phone\": \"+919876543212\",\n    \"address\": \"123 Business Park\",\n    \"city\": \"Mumbai\",\n    \"state\": \"Maharashtra\",\n    \"pincode\": \"400001\"\n  }\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}/profiles",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["users", "{{userId}}", "profiles"]
            },
            "description": "**Step 2 of Employee Onboarding**\n\nCreate employee profile with organization-specific data.\n\n**Auto-assigns:** `employee_basic` role\n\n**Profile Data Fields:**\n- `employeeId`: Company employee ID\n- `designation`: Job title\n- `department`: Department name\n- `joiningDate`: Date of joining (YYYY-MM-DD)\n- `email`: Work email\n- `phone`: Work phone\n- `address`, `city`, `state`, `pincode`: Work address"
          },
          "response": []
        },
